{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "1. 在店内场景下，客户提出软件支持等长期问题时，必须现场展示官方政策页面，而非口头承诺。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "2. 现场演示后，务必主动确认客户体验结果，避免让客户自行反馈。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "3. 即使客户主动要求成交，也应使用closing action（如assumptive close）来巩固交易，并处理潜在异议。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "4. 对于skepticism高的客户，每次承诺都要附带证据（如官网、演示）。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "content": "5. 在S3阶段，必须完成消异三部曲（共鸣→转换→佐证），否则无法进入S4。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "name": "现场佐证破疑法", "condition": "当客户对产品承诺（如软件更新、性能参数）表示怀疑时", "example": "客户质疑软件支持时，销冠直接打开官网政策页面展示。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "name": "现场验证闭环法", "condition": "当客户要求现场测试功能时", "example": "客户要求文件传输测试，销冠发起传输后应主动询问“您收到了吗？格式是否完整？”以完成闭环。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "reusable_tactic", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "name": "体验即成交法", "condition": "当客户试用产品后表示满意时", "example": "客户试用M-Pencil后表示“感觉不错”，销冠立即说“那我们现在就锁定这台吧？”", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "objection": "长期软件支持担忧", "rebuttal_template": "（共鸣）我完全理解，很多安卓平板确实更新支持不足。（转换）但华为MatePad系列承诺3年大版本更新和4年安全补丁，与iPad看齐。（佐证）来，我直接打开我们马来西亚官网的政策页面给您看，白纸黑字写得很清楚。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "objection": "文件传输格式问题", "rebuttal_template": "（现场演示）我现在就把这个带表格的PDF通过蓝牙发到您手机，您打开看看格式是否完整。如果没问题，以后您也可以用Google Drive同步，双重保障。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
{"type": "rebuttal_template", "session_id": "session_20260610_193925_p1", "persona_id": "db:1", "outcome": "DEAL_DONE", "objection": "手写笔体验对比", "rebuttal_template": "（现场体验）您亲自拿这支M-Pencil在屏幕上写写画画，感受一下延迟。它采用NearLink技术，延迟低至2ms，和Apple Pencil几乎无差别。", "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260610_201929"}
